---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { pricing } from '../lib/data';

const path = '/how-we-work';
---
<Base path={path}>
<div>
<div style="padding:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px) clamp(40px,5vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14)">
<div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#8a5a3c;margin-bottom:30px">HOW WE WORK &amp; PRICING</div>
<h1 style="margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,64px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.025em;max-width:18ch;text-wrap:balance">Fixed price, senior hands, <em style="color:#8a5a3c">built to be handed over</em>.</h1>
<p style="margin:30px 0 0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33;max-width:680px;text-wrap:pretty">Every engagement is priced against a defined outcome before it starts, led personally by Brannan, and finished when your team owns the result. This page sets out how that works in practice, and roughly what it costs.</p>
</div>
<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14)">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 28px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.02em">Indicative pricing</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr));gap:1px;background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.16);--cell:1">
{pricing.map((pr) => (<Fragment>
<div style="background:#f5f2ea;outline:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.16);padding:28px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#8a5a3c">{pr.kicker}</div><div style="font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-size:23px;line-height:1.15">{pr.title}</div><div style="font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-size:32px;font-weight:300;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-top:6px">{pr.price}</div><div style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;color:#5c5d51">{pr.note}</div></div>
</Fragment>))}
</div>
<p style="margin:18px 0 0;font-size:12.5px;color:#8a5a3c;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;letter-spacing:.04em">Ranges are placeholders — set real bands before publication, or remove the figures and keep the structure.</p>
</div>
<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);background:#eeeade">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 30px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.02em">The principles behind the price</h2>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(250px,1fr));gap:34px">
<div style="border-top:2px solid #8a5a3c;padding-top:18px"><h3 style="margin:0 0 9px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">Outcome, not hours</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33">We agree what done looks like and a price for it. If it takes longer, that's our problem; if it's faster, you still get the outcome.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:2px solid rgba(21,22,15,.25);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="margin:0 0 9px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">Your stack, your accounts</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33">Everything is built in your repos, cloud and AI accounts. You own the IP and the running costs are visible to you from day one.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:2px solid rgba(21,22,15,.25);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="margin:0 0 9px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">Confidentiality by default</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33">NDA before any data or code is seen. Client work is described anonymously unless you'd like it named.</p></div>
<div style="border-top:2px solid rgba(21,22,15,.25);padding-top:18px"><h3 style="margin:0 0 9px;font-size:19px;font-weight:600">A defined end</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33">Handover is part of the scope, not an extra. Retainers are offered where they help, never assumed.</p></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</Base>
